{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/2ea74bc4de76...116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/2ea74bc4de76...116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466","permalink_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/OmniNode-ai:2ea74bc...OmniNode-ai:116b491","diff_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/2ea74bc4de76...116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/2ea74bc4de76...116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"2ea74bc4de7623456bb20f303391ca2b2361a922","node_id":"C_kwDOPuAjtNoAKDJlYTc0YmM0ZGU3NjIzNDU2YmIyMGYzMDMzOTFjYTJiMjM2MWE5MjI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Jonah Gray","email":"jonah@omninode.ai","date":"2026-09-06T10:13:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-06T10:13:54Z"},"message":"fix(OMN-17201): deploy-gateway.sh passed a --repo package the lock-pin preflight rejects (#3236)\n\nOMN-16296 (#2822) dropped onex_change_control from the sibling clone manifest --\nit is no longer installed into the runtime image, so\ncheck_sibling_lock_pins.py's DEFAULT_PACKAGE_REPO_DIRS no longer carries\n\"onex-change-control\" and its argparse --repo validator rejects it outright.\nThat PR updated deploy-runtime.sh's copy of the argv and missed\ndeploy-gateway.sh's, so every BUILD_SOURCE=workspace gateway deploy has been\ndying in the preflight since it merged:\n\n    check_sibling_lock_pins.py: error: argument --repo: unknown package\n      'onex-change-control'; expected one of ['omnibase-compat',\n      'omnibase-core', 'omnibase-infra', 'omnibase-spi', 'omnimarket']\n    [deploy-gateway] ERROR: Sibling lock-pin preflight FAILED.\n\nThat is the only deploy path for the omninode-gateway lane, and workspace mode\nis the only mode that can carry unreleased dev code -- which is exactly what\nwas needed on 2026-09-06 to ship #3221 (d8833a7f) to the forwarder whose\noutbound cloud leg had been wedged 8768s across 294 reconnects on\n\"outbound payload tenant_id does not match attached tenant\".\n\nThe regression test asserts the script's --repo set against\ncheck_sibling_lock_pins.py's own accepted-package map rather than a copied\nliteral, so the two cannot drift apart again silently. RED on the unpatched\nscript (unknown: ['onex-change-control']), GREEN after.\n\nOMN-17201","tree":{"sha":"ff09593b01b22441cd0b267bb053fda2ca67a71a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/git/trees/ff09593b01b22441cd0b267bb053fda2ca67a71a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/git/commits/2ea74bc4de7623456bb20f303391ca2b2361a922","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnTziCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8hoQAG2SYfITd2FOG7W+MIknsbMX\nJJ3wnsFocQRzaNtzn90Ne3p4douudJLnV0SNoxxtN9XMb4tQYegEe7kDkCZKR9Bc\njLFQ2CZd3SQsN07GCBiYoWGKcWAJWaxeM/tEBNI8LdsGtd7QWEAi4A77uDaK12bN\nyxZFkDM2MC15yUusoVXy1rfS0C0vIeG1hikCSyUwUx+U2u399i6eXsUMovbRw3Jp\nS1lgM2A9NJfNOPtuh7v9I/zAS+j970KiAyylEtpqptQ81oyD5xOpEZTWyP0F4U9l\nYxXOi+38VQ2FRDijmF+QXKrlwpqCJV4cQ/wecNEQYsMI1w4EOKoAOnBSWhxJH8HC\nwiKVkVzpoH87RcbyG1pJ74vu3kpXKFWj+RP9rewyoH/DDOV+QrKwORjrUk5PxLtM\nZmnFr62Up19vK0mdXR8F2/LAaq1L8ssArgnfqipYKLPE6pgZOQTrD/EoRY+UrvEl\nVAGW9Ng+WcvEIN5UdLAc6sFZMUgPdnHcPYFoSMvG0APAZ8XO0/ObX+kN2HPcnlW8\n5se5vi6Y/3Ou5xt/iatgvFzOwqj71vINyJle85jQkPg2HXnZTFgyXT4JXHEkpa1g\n/owkDOvKQeEOmkK95mk/RDeAXkKYXmcOaWtT93MeTqTidCGLURzvvbg/6p40rCde\nUQTWYcc2VeOnvdkmY2Tw\n=1wSt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ff09593b01b22441cd0b267bb053fda2ca67a71a\nparent c6c4af89a0f6bcc56cd97bc7940830930e354ad5\nauthor Jonah Gray <jonah@omninode.ai> 1788689634 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788689634 +0000\n\nfix(OMN-17201): deploy-gateway.sh passed a --repo package the lock-pin preflight rejects (#3236)\n\nOMN-16296 (#2822) dropped onex_change_control from the sibling clone manifest --\nit is no longer installed into the runtime image, so\ncheck_sibling_lock_pins.py's DEFAULT_PACKAGE_REPO_DIRS no longer carries\n\"onex-change-control\" and its argparse --repo validator rejects it outright.\nThat PR updated deploy-runtime.sh's copy of the argv and missed\ndeploy-gateway.sh's, so every BUILD_SOURCE=workspace gateway deploy has been\ndying in the preflight since it merged:\n\n    check_sibling_lock_pins.py: error: argument --repo: unknown package\n      'onex-change-control'; expected one of ['omnibase-compat',\n      'omnibase-core', 'omnibase-infra', 'omnibase-spi', 'omnimarket']\n    [deploy-gateway] ERROR: Sibling lock-pin preflight FAILED.\n\nThat is the only deploy path for the omninode-gateway lane, and workspace mode\nis the only mode that can carry unreleased dev code -- which is exactly what\nwas needed on 2026-09-06 to ship #3221 (d8833a7f) to the forwarder whose\noutbound cloud leg had been wedged 8768s across 294 reconnects on\n\"outbound payload tenant_id does not match attached tenant\".\n\nThe regression test asserts the script's --repo set against\ncheck_sibling_lock_pins.py's own accepted-package map rather than a copied\nliteral, so the two cannot drift apart again silently. RED on the unpatched\nscript (unknown: ['onex-change-control']), GREEN after.\n\nOMN-17201","verified_at":"2026-09-06T10:13:55Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/2ea74bc4de7623456bb20f303391ca2b2361a922","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commit/2ea74bc4de7623456bb20f303391ca2b2361a922","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/2ea74bc4de7623456bb20f303391ca2b2361a922/comments","author":{"login":"jonahgabriel","id":1002253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDIyNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1002253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel","html_url":"ht