lwLezmxbZJE8kgT3\nZFANPCtxuAFsfqti7zV6XP8gBF1QDQwASZ74dMGsUFuG5bAetpWaqAHDMw1tLI1F\nWGtdfdJTPSsklm6yzKycCdn1O8NlwyUKK4mrkVO8DPQD96/hcTt0soMH6xnikyFY\nEs2gEWJlSr07m48PL5j2OjWFb9e4J5Um2uuhN6VSSy4Xlmr2SE9Dxr9OdstmKfFG\nM71viKe3rsU6AhqAC25kkDiDh+MQUdtXIQpvnb3e9eflwMRkHTaZP2ks39rEJ22e\nl2dECtqlUW5kZFch/Tl7NFhkrI6GrDDsn/jKiWOCLetKbIFRw3nHH95iBwJYa3CV\nAXKb2bIHmH1khl1nmfrl\n=9ppY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c505659670ca9947e2533f2b811c2112271fb0c5\nparent f9326a95b757aa8659ce7e9582ad6f42a6e4a614\nauthor Jonah Gray <jonah@omninode.ai> 1788701295 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788701295 +0000\n\nfix(OMN-17793): harden ARCH-004 worktree identity (#3241)\n\n* fix(OMN-17793): harden ARCH-004 worktree identity\n\n* fix(OMN-17793): fail closed on untrusted Git roots","verified_at":"2026-09-06T13:28:16Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/3c9ad7fa2d69d24e7826b8d9efa6b6c22f8476bf","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commit/3c9ad7fa2d69d24e7826b8d9efa6b6c22f8476bf","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/3c9ad7fa2d69d24e7826b8d9efa6b6c22f8476bf/comments","author":{"login":"jonahgabriel","id":1002253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDIyNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1002253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel","html_url":"https://github.com/jonahgabriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f9326a95b757aa8659ce7e9582ad6f42a6e4a614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/f9326a95b757aa8659ce7e9582ad6f42a6e4a614","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commit/f9326a95b757aa8659ce7e9582ad6f42a6e4a614"}]},{"sha":"6c3acf69086868979ad8c34e608750534d717c70","node_id":"C_kwDOPuAjtNoAKDZjM2FjZjY5MDg2ODY4OTc5YWQ4YzM0ZTYwODc1MDUzNGQ3MTdjNzA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Jonah Gray","email":"jonah@omninode.ai","date":"2026-09-06T13:39:17Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-06T13:39:17Z"},"message":"chore(OMN-17980): pin omnibase-core 0.47.4 for the 0.38.19 cut (#3242)\n\n* chore(OMN-17980): pin omnibase-core 0.47.4 for the 0.38.19 cut\n\nomnibase_core 0.47.3 shipped a RuntimeLocal terminal-correlation regression\n(commit 1bd884e5, PR #1645) that made every canonical def-B ORCHESTRATOR run\ndiscard its own terminal as foreign and time out. Core #1655 (squash\n9386a87335742375575a46aa934cae3328be8597) fixed it and published 0.47.4 to\nPyPI. omnibase_infra 0.38.19 must carry the fixed core, so both declared pin\nblocks move 0.47.3 -> 0.47.4 and the three surfaces that mirror that pin\nfollow it.\n\nChanged:\n- pyproject.toml: [project.dependencies] and [tool.uv] override-dependencies.\n- uv.lock: refreshed with `uv lock --refresh-package omnibase-core` (a bare\n  `uv lock` resolves against a stale cached index and reports \"no version of\n  omnibase-core==0.47.4\"). The diff is the specifier in both places plus the\n  sdist/wheel URL, hash, size and upload-time rows.\n- src/omnibase_infra/runtime/version_compatibility.py: _FALLBACK_MATRIX\n  regenerated by `uv run python scripts/update_version_matrix.py`, the\n  generator the drift test names in its own failure message.\n- tests/fixtures/seams/core_release/0.46.11_expected_symbols.json:\n  core_version 0.47.3 -> 0.47.4, following the fixture's own documented\n  update procedure. Its stale header comment (0.47.0) is corrected to match\n  the field. No symbol or typed_field row moved: the seam test's only finding\n  against installed 0.47.4 was the version stamp, so the frozen symbol set and\n  every frozen field type already hold on the new core.\n\nRED before, on the governed pre-push full-suite escalation (lab host h201.3,\nrun omnibase_infra-fc488dc4f5da-56255): 2 failed, 26663 passed --\ntests/unit/runtime/test_fallback_matrix_sync.py::TestFallbackMatrixSync::test_update_version_matrix_check_passes\n(\"DRIFT DETECTED: _FALLBACK_MATRIX is out of date with pyproject.toml\") and\ntests/unit/runtime/test_seam_released_core_pin.py::test_seam_released_core_pin_importable_and_typed\n(\"[version] omnibase_core.__version__='0.47.4' but fixture freezes '0.47.3'\").\nBoth reproduced locally before either was touched. Neither assertion was\nweakened: the matrix was regenerated by its own generator and the fixture was\nadvanced by its own procedure.\n\nGREEN after: 29 passed across test_fallback_matrix_sync.py,\ntest_seam_released_core_pin.py and test_version_compatibility.py.\n\nPin verification:\n- PyPI /pypi/omnibase-core/0.47.4/json => HTTP 200. Positive control\n  /0.47.3/json => 200; negative control /0.99.99/json => 404.\n- Built wheel METADATA reads `Requires-Dist: omnibase-core==0.47.4`.\n- GREEN: scripts/ci/verify_pypi_pin_resolvability.py dist/ => exit 0.\n- RED (non-vacuity): the same tree with the [project.dependencies] line\n  temporarily set to omnibase-core==0.47.99, rebuilt into a scratch dist,\n  => exit 1, \"no version of omnibase-core==0.47.99\". pyproject was restored\n  byte-for-byte afterwards.\n\nQuality: ruff format --check clean (5275 files), ruff check clean,\nmypy src/ --strict => \"Success: no issues found in 2967 source files\".\n\nNo prod promotion, no runtime lane mutation, no cluster mutation, no\ncredential rotation.\n\n* chore(OMN-17980): rebind the runner image identity to the new lock\n\n`docker/runners/runner-image.lock.json` folds the dependency manifest\n(`pyproject.toml` + `uv.lock`) into the runner image identity digest, so the\ncore pin bump in the parent commit invalidates it. `runner-image-build-smoke`\non PR #3242 refused with:\n\n    runner image shared_env_digest is stale\n    (recorded='e91fc7f26676420976a047bc', recomputed='109757f9c25300aeb09c0459');\n    run scripts/ci/runner_image_identity.py --mode generate\n\nRegenerated with exactly that command. The rewritten `shared_env_digest` is\n`109757f9c25300aeb09c0459` — byte-identical to the value CI recomputed, which\nis the confirmation that the two sides now agree rather than merely that a\nnumber changed. `identity_digest` follows it to `71d3d5134b9f6fe8f375e0753018a7f5`\n(image_version stays 7). Nothing else in the file moves: base image digest,\nrunner/uv/gh/kubectl/python versions and the shared-env install args are\nuntouched.\n\nThis is the same companion edit PR #3228 (the post-release dev bump to\n0.38.19) and #3229 made for the same reason — every commit that moves\npyproject.toml or uv.lock rebinds this file.","tree":{"sha":"3e5c19c5034bbe1b39529a113d082ebb40709117","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/git/trees/3e5c19c5034bbe1b39529a113d082ebb40709117"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/git/commits/6c3acf69086868979ad8c34e608750534d717c70","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnW0FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZlgQADNlKlb9x10A6+7oMZ7J4uVi\nHlCUdp2hqpT6Uc1na4kigQ5lPL3nqoOJdpPJWWZ2N/N9PKiVouiKbroC0shzsQp7\nOjMUeXCOd4dMOW2bKga2hGlVpNn/vfCZ3neiLmlHLKKVSAKgCrfyWMdWor7xVTaI\nuedMOlfdsRFnZSHrapjy4J0IhCMjRlqarcjKhL94HCIxwe2GRQZJ2FMKXwhA3uwn\nVI1IpGRLFEpaS0fTX//fQOMS73z7AwG3se1kgr55KJcOtvde6u0irPYg0yQn672b\nO6qwJs2HaisXjQoIM1j1SJhgvHy4Vlbk/wpCZrDh1Cg60yoQNuGdLeQ0LTSOVuws\neXkCttL+bvIXD156jIykblnSU/tz01EJfdLSZDeEvARXPaN0RI1ZBN69I2BZKX+x\n4M55B84ZAlJK6DQe8Z2k9jGU7wATXkLI2bBhYMLxBXwZ1uwRwfUAPJySD9CNk7zl\nrK4jEjLjL/Dnvpxaw6/NXJJ1E1NDNmPNCbAIN6rCLJaC9AOYOwdqrWsGrx/rp/cm\nDDbNo967lfSbBrbPvIxOP9h+mvdMXBRFaur2WdVEH4o5KIAxaM27d6xssWZhz899\nEXWB7zi07eGaoVhMwKWWyXtBvrqynKgTKN+nOp9G6926QmedldAqpyjL3eq7wJ6j\nx+0DtNtmnFhbyF0GiwnH\n=rgYG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 3e5c19c5034bbe1b39529a113d082ebb40709117\nparent 3c9ad7fa2d69d24e7826b8d9efa6b6c22f8476bf\nauthor Jonah Gray <jonah@omninode.ai> 1788701957 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788701957 +0000\n\nchore(OMN-17980): pin omnibase-core 0.47.4 for the 0.38.19 cut (#3242)\n\n* chore(OMN-17980): pin omnibase-core 0.47.4 for the 0.38.19 cut\n\nomnibase_core 0.47.3 shipped a RuntimeLocal terminal-correlation regression\n(commit 1bd884e5, PR #1645) that made every canonical def-B ORCHESTRATOR run\ndiscard its own terminal as foreign and time out. Core #1655 (squash\n9386a87335742375575a46aa934cae3328be8597) fixed it and published 0.47.4 to\nPyPI. omnibase_infra 0.38.19 must carry the fixed core, so both declared pin\nblocks move 0.47.3 -> 0.47.4 and the three surfaces that mirror that pin\nfollow it.\n\nChanged:\n- pyproject.toml: [project.dependencies] and [tool.uv] override-dependencies.\n- uv.lock: refreshed with `uv lock --refresh-package omnibase-core` (a bare\n  `uv lock` resolves against a stale cached index and reports \"no version of\n  omnibase-core==0.47.4\"). The diff is the specifier in both places plus the\n  sdist/wheel URL, hash, size and upload-time rows.\n- src/omnibase_infra/runtime/version_compatibility.py: _FALLBACK_MATRIX\n  regenerated by `uv run python scripts/update_version_matrix.py`, the\n  generator the drift test names in its own failure message.\n- tests/fixtures/seams/core_release/0.46.11_expected_symbols.json:\n  core_version 0.47.3 -> 0.47.4, following the fixture's own documented\n  update procedure. Its stale header comment (0.47.0) is corrected to match\n  the field. No symbol or typed_field row moved: the seam test's only finding\n  against installed 0.47.4 was the version stamp, so the frozen symbol set and\n  every frozen field type already hold on the new core.\n\nRED before, on the governed pre-push full-suite escalation (lab host h201.3,\nrun omnibase_infra-fc488dc4f5da-56255): 2 failed, 26663 passed --\ntests/unit/runtime/test_fallback_matrix_sync.py::TestFallbackMatrixSync::test_update_version_matrix_check_passes\n(\"DRIFT DETECTED: _FALLBACK_MATRIX is out of date with pyproject.toml\") and\ntests/unit/runtime/test_seam_released_core_pin.py::test_seam_released_core_pin_importable_and_typed\n(\"[version] omnibase_core.__version__='0.47.4' but fixture freezes '0.47.3'\").\nBoth reproduced locally before either was touched. Neither assertion was\nweakened: the matrix was regenerated by its own generator and the fixture was\nadvanced by its own procedure.\n\nGREEN after: 29 passed across test_fallback_matrix_sync.py,\ntest_seam_released_core_pin.py and test_version_compatibility.py.\n\nPin verification:\n- PyPI /pypi/omnibase-core/0.47.4/json => HTTP 200. Positive control\n  /0.47.3/json => 200; negative control /0.99.99/json => 404.\n- Built wheel METADATA reads `Requires-Dist: omnibase-core==0.47.4`.\n- GREEN: scripts/ci/verify_pypi_pin_resolvability.py dist/ => exit 0.\n- RED (non-vacuity): the same tree with the [project.dependencies] line\n  temporarily set to omnibase-core==0.47.99, rebuilt into a scratch dist,\n  => exit 1, \"no version of omnibase-core==0.47.99\". pyproject was restored\n  byte-for-byte afterwards.\n\nQuality: ruff format --check clean (5275 files), ruff check clean,\nmypy src/ --strict => \"Success: no issues found in 2967 source files\".\n\nNo prod promotion, no runtime lane mutation, no cluster mutation, no\ncredential rotation.\n\n* chore(OMN-17980): rebind the runner image identity to the new lock\n\n`docker/runners/runner-image.lock.json` folds the dependency manifest\n(`pyproject.toml` + `uv.lock`) into the runner image identity digest, so the\ncore pin bump in the parent commit invalidates it. `runner-image-build-smoke`\non PR #3242 refused with:\n\n    runner image shared_env_digest is stale\n    (recorded='e91fc7f26676420976a047bc', recomputed='109757f9c25300aeb09c0459');\n    run scripts/ci/runner_image_identity.py --mode generate\n\nRegenerated with exactly that command. The rewritten `shared_env_digest` is\n`109757f9c25300aeb09c0459` — byte-identical to the value CI recomputed, which\nis the confirmation that the two sides now agree rather than merely that a\nnumber changed. `identity_digest` follows it to `71d3d5134b9f6fe8f375e0753018a7f5`\n(image_version stays 7). Nothing else in the file moves: base image digest,\nrunner/uv/gh/kubectl/python versions and the shared-env install args are\nuntouched.\n\nThis is the same companion edit PR #3228 (the post-release dev bump to\n0.38.19) and #3229 made for the same reason — every commit that moves\npyproject.toml or uv.lock rebinds this file.","verified_at":"2026-09-06T13:39:18Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/6c3acf69086868979ad8c34e608750534d717c70","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commit/6c3acf69086868979ad8c34e608750534d717c70","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/6c3acf69086868979ad8c34e608750534d717c70/comments","author":{"login":"jonahgabriel","id":1002253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDIyNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1002253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel","html_url":"https://github.com/jonahgabriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3c9ad7fa2d69d24e7826b8d9efa6b6c22f8476bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/3c9ad7fa2d69d24e7826b8d9efa6b6c22f8476bf","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commit/3c9ad7fa2d69d24e7826b8d9efa6b6c22f8476bf"}]},{"sha":"0fa750eb9ad649bb2fe4d11d3f4831b5577ad005","node_id":"C_kwDOPuAjtNoAKDBmYTc1MGViOWFkNjQ5YmIyZmU0ZDExZDNmNDgzMWI1NTc3YWQwMDU","commit":{"author":{"name":"onexbot-occ-writer[bot]","email":"307849072+onexbot-occ-writer[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-06T14:44:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-06T14:44:40Z"},"message":"chore(OMN-13912): post-release dev version bump to 0.38.20 (#3244)\n\n* chore(OMN-13912): post-release dev version bump to 0.38.20\n\nDisarms the OMN-13412 release-identity gate that publishing\nv0.38.19 armed against dev.\n\nTriggered-by: https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/actions/runs/34037128862\n\n* chore(OMN-13912): refresh runner image identity lock\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: onexbot-occ-writer[bot] <onexbot-occ-writer[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: jonahgabriel <jonah@omninode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"51354ad61fe81b1da2b582823bf516976f4fd7a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/git/trees/51354ad61fe81b1da2b582823bf516976f4fd7a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/git/commits/0fa750eb9ad649bb2fe4d11d3f4831b5577ad005","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnXxYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAA